---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import { images } from '../data/assets';
const breadcrumbs=[{label:'Why Talon',href:'/why-talon/'}];
const reasons=[
 ['Group-first from the beginning','We plan around the organizer, traveler mix, likely headcount, and the reason these people are traveling together.'],
 ['Support beyond booking','Reservations are only part of the work. Participant information, readiness, supplier coordination, and operational handoffs matter too.'],
 ['Active without performance theater','A trip can be demanding, comfortable, beginner-friendly, cultural, skill-based, or a mixture. The actual demands should be clear.'],
 ['Local specialists where they matter','Technical instruction, mountain guiding, diving, destination operations, and other specialist services can be coordinated with appropriate local providers.']
];
---
<BaseLayout title="Why Plan Group Travel With Talon Expeditions" description="Why clubs, communities, teams, and private groups use Talon Expeditions for group-first travel planning, active and experience-led trip design, organizer support, and traveler preparation." image={images.wildlife} breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}>
  <section class="av-inner-hero" style={`background-image:url('${images.wildlife}')`}><div class="shell"><h1>Why Choose Us</h1><Breadcrumbs items={breadcrumbs}/></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="shell"><div class="av-why-intro"><div><p class="eyebrow">Why Talon Expeditions</p><h2>A group travel partner should make the trip clearer before it makes it bigger.</h2></div><p>Talon combines custom trip design with organizer support, traveler preparation, and destination-specific supplier coordination. The model is especially useful when the trip involves more complexity than a simple flight-and-hotel booking.</p></div><div class="av-why-image" style={`background-image:url('${images.group}')`}></div><div class="av-why-grid">{reasons.map((item,index)=><div class="av-why-item"><div class="av-why-item-head"><h3>{item[0]}</h3><span class="num">0{index+1}</span></div><p>{item[1]}</p></div>)}</div></div></section>
  <section class="av-newsletter-hero" style={`background-image:url('${images.coast}')`}><div class="shell av-newsletter-grid"><div class="av-newsletter-card"><p class="eyebrow">A Different Kind of Proof</p><h2>A planning method you can evaluate before you book.</h2><p>We explain the planning process, support model, role of local specialists, traveler preparation, and service boundaries so the relationship is understandable before anyone commits.</p><a class="button button-small" href="/how-it-works/">See How Planning Works</a></div><div class="av-stat-row"><div class="av-stat"><strong>CLIA</strong><span>Cruise-industry infrastructure</span></div><div class="av-stat"><strong>IATA</strong><span>Air-travel infrastructure</span></div><div class="av-stat"><strong>ARC</strong><span>U.S. travel infrastructure</span></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="av-process"><div class="shell av-process-grid"><div class="av-process-visual" style={`background-image:url('${images.planning}')`}><div class="av-process-callout"><h3>The trip should still feel like yours.</h3><p>Support should remove friction without removing the personality of the group.</p></div></div><div class="av-process-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Our Approach</p><h2>Professional behind the scenes. Personal to the group.</h2><p class="av-process-lead">Large fixed-tour brands are useful when travelers want established inventory. Independent planning works when a group wants full control. Talon serves groups that want the trip shaped around them with meaningful support.</p><div class="av-process-topline"><strong>Start with the group</strong><a href="/private-group-travel/">↗</a></div><div class="av-process-steps"><div class="av-process-step"><div class="av-process-icon">◎</div><div><h3>Clear Organizer Workload</h3><p>Fewer disconnected suppliers and a clearer path from interest to departure.</p></div></div><div class="av-process-step"><div class="av-process-icon">▤</div><div><h3>Preparation Included</h3><p>Documents, equipment, fitness, rooming, and arrivals are part of the operating picture.</p></div></div><div class="av-process-step"><div class="av-process-icon">⌖</div><div><h3>Worldwide Scope</h3><p>Destination-specific route, season, supplier, and support decisions rather than one generic formula.</p></div></div><div class="av-process-step"><div class="av-process-icon">↗</div><div><h3>Room to Grow</h3><p>A group can develop recurring departures, annual journeys, or skill progression over time.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
